The agent runtime (:agent:core, :agent:runtime) is a Kotlin re-implementation of the
architecture of DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness):
its plugin model, session log, agent loop, tool pipeline, permission presets and compaction.
Tool names, event names and the compaction summary sections follow that project.

